@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz/liveness

### 2. [AUTH VC3] Vecino al día (VC3 + B14) inicia sesión en vc3.lasvillas.club
# @name loginResidentB14
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Host: vc3.lasvillas.club
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 190.236.10.14

{
  "username": "B14",
  "password": "VC3-B14"
}

### 3. [AUTH VC3] Vigilante de Garita VC3 inicia sesión
# @name loginGuard
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Host: vc3.lasvillas.club
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 181.65.20.10

{
  "username": "guardia1",
  "password": "guardia123"
}

### 4. [AUTH VC3] Administrador de la Junta Directiva VC3 inicia sesión
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Host: vc3.lasvillas.club
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 181.65.20.99

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 5. [VECINO VC3+B14] Crea un pase con 1 toque (villa_id=VC3 y lot_id=B14 salen del JWT)
# @name createPass
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/passes
Host: vc3.lasvillas.club
Authorization: Bearer {{loginResidentB14.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 190.236.10.14

{
  "pass_type": "TAXI",
  "visitor_info": "Uber Gris"
}

### 6. [GARITA VC3] Vigilante verifica el QR/Código de 6 dígitos y registra DNI + Placa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/passes/verify
Host: vc3.lasvillas.club
Authorization: Bearer {{loginGuard.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 181.65.20.10

{
  "code": "{{createPass.response.body.code}}",
  "visitor_dni": "45891230",
  "vehicle_plate": "B7J-412"
}

### 7. [ADMIN VC3] Carga Masiva de Lotes con Correo Electrónico (Upsert + Onboarding)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lots/bulk
Host: vc3.lasvillas.club
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lots": [
    {
      "lot_id": "B14",
      "owner_name": "Jesus Plasencia",
      "owner_email": "jesus.b14@lasvillas.club",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    },
    {
      "lot_id": "U28",
      "owner_name": "Familia Salgado",
      "owner_email": "salgado.u28@gmail.com",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    },
    {
      "lot_id": "P20",
      "owner_name": "Familia Torres",
      "owner_email": "torres.p20@gmail.com",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    }
  ]
}

### 8. [ADMIN VC3] Consultar IPs bloqueadas en VC3 y vecino sospechoso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/security/blocked-ips
Host: vc3.lasvillas.club
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
